OL,3,GNEWSASecond postponed meeting puts
OL,4,Achildren 'at risk'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA key meeting about child protection
OL,7,Ffailings was postponed again after
OL,8,Fcouncillors did not show up for the
OL,9,Fsecond time.
OL,11,FNot enough panel members, made up of
OL,12,FCounty Durham councillors and
OL,13,Findependent representatives, attended a
OL,14,Fmeeting about Durham Constabulary's
OL,15,Fresponse to child protection failings
OL,16,Ffor it to legally go ahead on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
